ion such as Singapore, with its pristine charm preserved and maintained by the authorities. ... Bugis Street is one of Singapore’s most popular street shopping areas, known for its budget fashion, accessories, souvenirs, local snacks, and lively atmosphere.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 1.0255148999858648}

